#: ../../docs/data/todo.rst:2 3fe3f74e1a674a769881aff700a36978
msgid "WebDAV 协议访问"
msgstr "WebDAV Access"

#: ../../docs/data/todo.rst:4 1545ffa0d0b744709ac7c2f535b4e056
msgid "由于不是所有实例都提供SSH端口的访问方式，对于需要批量上传或下载的用户，ChinaSRC还提供了WebDAV协议的文件访问方式。"
msgstr ""
"Because not all instances expose SSH, ChinaSRC also provides WebDAV file "
"access for users who need bulk upload or download."

#: ../../docs/data/todo.rst:6 673df46644a14e3799f98ee1f8866d55
msgid ""
"WebDAV是一种通信协议，支持大批量的文件传输。对于用户来说，相当于将ChinaSRC的服务器以网盘的形式挂载到用户的个人电脑，用户将个人电脑里的数据拷贝或者上传到ChinaSRC的服务器上。"
msgstr ""
"WebDAV is a protocol that supports large-scale file transfer. For users, it "
"is like mounting ChinaSRC storage as a network drive on a personal computer "
"and copying or uploading data to ChinaSRC servers."

#: ../../docs/data/todo.rst:8 b1cb3fc79ec44977942b3e0dd3894746
msgid "WebDAV协议访问的地址是\\ |webdav url| \\ 。用户验证请使用ChinaSRC用户名和密码。"
msgstr ""
"The WebDAV access URL is \\ |webdav url| \\. Use your ChinaSRC username and "
"password for authentication."

#: ../../docs/data/todo.rst:10 607a7bc7b64d408e8865c7ae0288721e
msgid ""
"Windows系统建议使用\\ `RaiDrive <https://www.raidrive.com/>`__\\ 或\\ `Cyberduck "
"<https://cyberduck.io/>`__\\ 。Mac系统建议使用\\ `Cyberduck "
"<https://cyberduck.io/>`__\\ 。Linux系统建议使用\\ `rclone "
"<https://rclone.org/docs/>`__\\ 。"
msgstr ""
"On Windows, use \\ `RaiDrive <https://www.raidrive.com/>`__\\ or \\ "
"`Cyberduck <https://cyberduck.io/>`__\\. On Mac, use \\ `Cyberduck "
"<https://cyberduck.io/>`__\\. On Linux, use \\ `rclone "
"<https://rclone.org/docs/>`__\\."

#: ../../docs/data/todo.rst:12 5144ad31807f4183bbc43e5263817ac0
