#: ../../docs/data/todo.rst:29 393f93e99f184b018a72fd37eedc22cd
msgid "Cyberduck使用说明"
msgstr "Using Cyberduck"

#: ../../docs/data/todo.rst:31 09be77c619074dbbba549274d4292614
msgid ""
"打开Cyberduck，点击“新建连接”，按照下图所示填写连接方式，要选择“WebDAV(HTTPS)”方式。用户验证请使用ChinaSRC用户名和密码。"
msgstr ""
"Open Cyberduck, click \"New Connection\", and configure the connection as "
"shown below. Select \"WebDAV (HTTPS)\". Use your ChinaSRC username and "
"password."

#: ../../docs/data/todo.rst:33 0e1a470b6cc1446dbc9a21473a5673f9
msgid "|cyberduck connect|"
msgstr "|cyberduck connect|"

#: ../../docs/data/todo.rst:35 068ce4d07a8347e6b0ef683b0ce8e5bb
msgid ""
"连接过程中出现任何提示，直接点“继续”。连接成功后，可以使用软件的创建文件夹、上传等功能。注意，使用共享实例，比如交互式的JupyterLab、RStudio、Stata、MATLAB的用户，目标文件夹是“MyData”文件夹。软件的“操作”按钮下有“新建文件夹”、“上传”等功能。"
msgstr ""
"If prompted during connection, click \"Continue\". After connecting, you can"
" create folders and upload files. For shared instances (interactive "
"JupyterLab, RStudio, Stata, MATLAB, etc.), use the \"MyData\" folder. Use "
"\"Action\" -> \"New Folder\" or \"Upload\"."

#: ../../docs/data/todo.rst:38 86dffa7ab4d54955af043461bf8c47e8
msgid "RaiDrive使用说明"
msgstr "Using RaiDrive"

#: ../../docs/data/todo.rst:40 be9cc701faa849768e613a3bf624cfd1
msgid ""
"下载\\ `RaiDrive "
"<http://xx.xx.xx.xx:8080/help/files/RaiDrive_2020.6.36.exe>`_\\ "
"并安装后，点击窗口顶部的“添加”按钮，按照下图所示创建WebDAV驱动器。"
msgstr ""
"Download and install \\ `RaiDrive "
"<http://xx.xx.xx.xx:8080/help/files/RaiDrive_2020.6.36.exe>`_\\, click "
"\"Add\" at the top, and create a WebDAV drive as shown below."

#: ../../docs/data/todo.rst:42 604dddecdcdd4c82bb06ed873bed7f84
msgid "|raidrive connect|"
msgstr "|raidrive connect|"

#: ../../docs/data/todo.rst:44 0614d6e52d0f4745b54f424a5543990e
msgid ""
"点击确定后，会跳出一个Windows资源浏览器窗口。RaiDrive已经把新添加的WebDAV连接创建成了一个网络存储驱动器，可以像操作本地磁盘一样从其他驱动器里拖拽文件或者拷贝到这个驱动器下的子目录中。"
msgstr ""
"After you click OK, Windows Explorer opens. RaiDrive maps the WebDAV "
"connection as a network drive; drag or copy files into its subdirectories "
"like a local disk."

#: ../../docs/data/todo.rst:48 484b7d21fc78416d873f3249933a2c43
msgid "RaiDrive WebDAV驱动器功能有局限"
msgstr "RaiDrive WebDAV drive limitations"

#: ../../docs/data/todo.rst:50 cafa29aedfe44ef695c5be37fd28853f
msgid "WebDAV驱动器里的文件不支持编辑，只支持创建和删除。"
msgstr ""
"Files on the WebDAV drive cannot be edited; only create and delete are "
"supported."

#: ../../docs/data/todo.rst:51 f382941c501545e6ba589de63615f315
msgid "根目录下不能创建目录或文件，只能在列出的顶层目录下操作。"
msgstr ""
"You cannot create files or folders in the root; work only under the listed "
"top-level directories."

#: ../../docs/data/todo.rst:54 369bfcda29f44c82adcc27afda8aa655
msgid "WinSCP使用说明"
msgstr "Using WinSCP"

#: ../../docs/data/todo.rst:56 d5e731a4805b4184bf1d85babfe3fd67
msgid ""
"打开 WinSCP ，在登录对话框中“新建站点”。按下图所示，选择“WebDAV”-“TLS/SSL隐式加密”、填入主机名和端口\\ |webdav "
"url| \\ ，使用ChinaSRC用户名和密码进行登录"
msgstr ""
"Open WinSCP and click \"New Site\". Select \"WebDAV\" -> \"TLS/SSL implicit "
"encryption\", enter the host and port \\ |webdav url| \\, and log in with "
"your ChinaSRC username and password."

#: ../../docs/data/todo.rst:58 1883c0c4a53e40feaea6b0d54166c0f0
msgid "|winscp connect|"
msgstr "|winscp connect|"

