#: ../../docs/data/todo.rst:100 590440525b754520a13454286fb849d1
msgid "4.关闭证书检查"
msgstr "4. Disable certificate verification"

#: ../../docs/data/todo.rst:103 13c7093089ad4885b6bd84460e0bc715
msgid "注意：此项必须关闭，不然远程操作会报错。"
msgstr "Note: this must be disabled; otherwise remote operations will fail."

#: ../../docs/data/todo.rst:105 59eb75d312ad4089b71da20b7e9b692b
msgid "有两种关闭检查的方式，如下："
msgstr "Two ways to disable verification:"

#: ../../docs/data/todo.rst:107 0a1c934bcad24c778f995c1c3beedd00
msgid ""
"1.在执行命令时带上\\ ``--no-check-certificate``\\ 参数，如：``rclone ls remote: --no-"
