msgstr ""
"1. Pass \\ ``--no-check-certificate``\\ on the command line, for example: "
"``rclone ls remote: --no-check-certificate``"

#: ../../docs/data/todo.rst:108 c2558b91d3c3432aa31b89c132578bbe
msgid "2.在环境变量里指定，如：``export RCLONE_NO_CHECK_CERTIFICATE=true``"
msgstr ""
"2. Set an environment variable, for example: ``export "
