"The ChinaSRC data management page limits download file count; pack results "
"in the VM before transfer."

#: ../../docs/data/todo.rst:146 1e47202a41a745288fb879dec6bad25e
msgid "Windows系统自带的WebDAV Client可以满足大多数文件拷贝需求，但是对单个文件的大小限制为4G，文件如果大于4G会报错。"
msgstr ""
"The built-in Windows WebDAV Client covers most copy needs but limits single "
